  "performance": {"required": true, "baselineFactor": 10},
  "hints": ["Split the lunch in two halves: a starter with a main, and a side with a dessert. The two halves must add up to the target.", "Go through every starter with every main and count, in a map, how many pairs give each total.", "Then go through every side with every dessert: the first half must cost the target MINUS this pair. GET that total from the map and, IF it IS NOT NOTHING, add its count to the answer."],
